### Load books
GET http://localhost:3001/books HTTP/1.1

### Create a book; priority is next, later, or someday
POST http://localhost:3001/books HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "A book to read",
  "priority": "next",
  "done": false
}

### Edit: PUT replaces the full record
PUT http://localhost:3001/books/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "An updated book",
  "priority": "later",
  "done": false
}

### Finish a book: PATCH changes one field
PATCH http://localhost:3001/books/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "done": true
}

### Delete a book
DELETE http://localhost:3001/books/1 HTTP/1.1
